  "title": "rdp: misc fixes and implement decoding of fastpath",
  "description": "The PR contains various fixes and micro improvements, but the biggest changes are the dissecting of fastpath packets (mouse moves, key strokes, ...). For now only inputs are fully decoded (client to server) mainly because in the other direction packets are almost always compressed using RDP compression (which is not ported yet in the dissector).",
